    "title": "Jawaker Hand, Trix & Solitaire",
    "description": "Experience ultimate entertainment and social interaction on Jawaker, the hub for popular card and board games. Enjoy 50+ games, interactive chats, and unique emotes. \r\n\r\n<b>Jawaker hosts the most exciting collection of games, like:</b>\r\n- Tarneeb, Syrian Tarneeb, 400, & Leekha\r\n- Trix, Trix Complex, & Complex CC\r\n- Hand, Banakil, & Hand Saudi\r\n- Solitaire with real players\r\n- Baloot, Bent Al Sbeet\r\n- Concan & Concan Partner\r\n- Basra, Tonj & Ronda\r\n- Jackaroo, Dama, & Jackaroo Complex\r\n- Kout Bo 4, Kout Bo 6\r\n- Saudi Deal & Monopo Deal\r\n- Domino and Dominoes Partnering\r\n- Ludo with voice chat\r\n- OONO and OONO plus\r\n- Chess \r\n- The Classic Snakes & Ladders with a twist!\r\n\r\n<b> Jawaker offers features that elevate players\u2019 experience, like: </b>\r\n- Real ready-to-play players all the time\r\n- Live voice chat with your microphone\r\n- Challenges against the top-ranked players globally\r\n- Playing with professional players\r\n- Weekly events\r\n- Socializing with players and chatting with friends\r\n- Responsive support team 24/7\r\n- Sending gifts to your friends \r\n- Create or join a club a collective experience\r\n\r\nAre you following us? Follow us on our social media\r\n- Facebook: http://facebook.com/jawaker\r\n- Instagram: http://instagram.com/jawaker\r\n- Twitter: http://twitter.com/jawaker",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience ultimate entertainment and social interaction on Jawaker, the hub for popular card and board games. Enjoy 50+ games, interactive chats, and unique emotes. <br><br><b>Jawaker hosts the most exciting collection of games, like:</b><br>- Tarneeb, Syrian Tarneeb, 400, &amp; Leekha<br>- Trix, Trix Complex, &amp; Complex CC<br>- Hand, Banakil, &amp; Hand Saudi<br>- Solitaire with real players<br>- Baloot, Bent Al Sbeet<br>- Concan &amp; Concan Partner<br>- Basra, Tonj &amp; Ronda<br>- Jackaroo, Dama, &amp; Jackaroo Complex<br>- Kout Bo 4, Kout Bo 6<br>- Saudi Deal &amp; Monopo Deal<br>- Domino and Dominoes Partnering<br>- Ludo with voice chat<br>- OONO and OONO plus<br>- Chess <br>- The Classic Snakes &amp; Ladders with a twist!<br><br><b> Jawaker offers features that elevate players\u2019 experience, like: </b><br>- Real ready-to-play players all the time<br>- Live voice chat with your microphone<br>- Challenges against the top-ranked players globally<br>- Playing with professional players<br>- Weekly events<br>- Socializing with players and chatting with friends<br>- Responsive support team 24/7<br>- Sending gifts to your friends <br>- Create or join a club a collective experience<br><br>Are you following us? Follow us on our social media<br>- Facebook: http://facebook.com/jawaker<br>- Instagram: http://instagram.com/jawaker<br>- Twitter: http://twitter.com/jawaker",
